    "fields": {
      "Name": "Predictive Studio Gates — Feature Pipelines",
      "Description": "The four Feature Pipeline gates (C1 -> C2.1, C2.2, C2.3, C2.5), the live job-title consistency measurement, W1 -> C3.2 (G7.7) and C1 -> C2.4 (G7.4: assembly reads the Feature Value in effect at each decision date, pinned at train time). C1 -> C2.4 runs on the server transport, and a server-transport bundle cannot follow a client-transport one in one process (#3251), so it is Sequence 1. Needs bizapps-common installed (its job-title Feature Pipeline is the gate subject), the truth sidecar, `pnpm run truth:provision` and `truth:load-c1`. Run with MJ_INTEGRATION_TEST=1 RUN_MUTATION_TESTS=1.",
      "Status": "Active"
    },
